{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/pulls/3173","id":4236944823,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQzxPK878iqW3","html_url":"https://github.com/decolua/9router/pull/3173","diff_url":"https://github.com/decolua/9router/pull/3173.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/decolua/9router/pull/3173.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/issues/3173","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/pulls/3173/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/pulls/3173/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/issues/3173/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decolua/9router/statuses/d388aca2a9f2d90d079a0bca680a64fb2f8ae362","number":3173,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(federation): multi-node edge→central federation (proxy, replication, failover)","user":{"login":"totalwindupflightsystems","id":230623677,"node_id":"U_kgDODb8JvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230623677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems","html_url":"https://github.com/totalwindupflightsystems","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Federation: multi-node edge → central\n\nThis PR implements the federation feature for 9router — a deployment topology where **edge instances proxy to a central instance by default**, replicate central's SQLite database, and keep serving independently during a central outage (eventual consistency). Standalone mode remains the default and is fully unchanged.\n\n### The five federation requirements (docs/federation-spec.md)\n\n1. **Edge → central proxying** — edges proxy `/v1/*` (SSE passthrough with flush/backpressure/abort propagation) and dashboard APIs to central by default (`FEDERATION_MODE=edge`).\n2. **Replication** — edges replicate central's SQLite DB (snapshot + delta pulls, revision watermark, transactional batches). A central outage leaves edges serving from the local replica.\n3. **Frontend once per host** — the dashboard binds per host/datacenter, not per instance.\n4. **Writes during outage** — queued locally (idempotency-keyed `pendingWrites`), drained and reconciled on recovery; fencing lease rejects 409.\n5. **Standalone unchanged** — `FEDERATION_MODE` unset/`standalone` boots exactly as upstream.\n\n### What's included\n\n- **Phases FED-001…FED-017**: federation config + schema migrations (adapter-chain-agnostic: better-sqlite3 / node:sqlite / sql.js), replication service + central API routes (`/api/federation/snapshot|delta|verify|status`), edge proxy + role guard + `FEDERATION_TOKEN` auth, LINKED/DEGRADED/RECOVERING failover state machine + write queue, FederationStatus UI banner, docs + docker-compose (central + 2 edges), E2E harness.\n- **Documentation**: `docs/FEDERATION.md` (deployment topologies, env matrix, failover runbook), `docs/federation-spec.md`.\n- **CI**: `.github/workflows/tests.yml` runs the vitest suite + regression gate on push/PR.\n- **Docker**: `Dockerfile.federation` + `docker-compose.federation.yml` (central + edges); the standalone image now ships the federation runtime and refuses to boot an edge without it (no silent inert mode).\n\n### Verification evidence\n\n- Full vitest suite: **1,810–1,817 pass / 88 known-fail (baseline) / 59 pending** — regression gate `verify-no-regression.mjs` **88=88, zero new failures**.\n- E2E (`tests/federation/e2e.mjs`): 3 instances — linked → kill central → degraded serving → recover → reconcile, **17/17 lifecycle steps PASS**.\n- Live dogfood (2026-08-08, real instances from the Docker layout): authenticated `/v1/chat/completions` through a LINKED edge returns the upstream completion; edge replica converges in seconds; central outage → edge serves `/v1` locally with `X-Federation-State: degraded`; recovery drains `pendingWrites` to central.\n- CI: `tests.yml` green on the PR head.\n\n### How to test\n\n```bash\n# central\nFEDERATION_MODE=central FEDERATION_TOKEN=… npm run start\n\n# edge\nFEDERATION_MODE=edge FEDERATION_CENTRAL_URL=http://central:20128 FEDERATION_TOKEN=… npm run start\n\n# or: docker compose -f docker-compose.federation.yml up\n```\n\nFull runbook: `docs/FEDERATION.md`.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-09T02:55:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:28:04Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"totalwindupflightsystems:federation-pr","ref":"federation-pr","repo":{"id":1326323441,"node_id":"R_kgDOTw4W8Q","name":"9router","full_name":"totalwindupflightsystems/9router","owner":{"login":"totalwindupflightsystems","id":230623677,"node_id":"U_kgDODb8JvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230623677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems","html_url":"https://github.com/totalwindupflightsystems","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwindupflightsystems/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totalwi